        },
        {
          "text": "Aron alamdog te yitto malo i wi kidi me Kor kite ame Rwot onwoŋo ociko, te wot to oko kuno, i mwaka me pyeraŋwennere ame jo Icrael oya kede i Miciri, i nino dwe acel, me dwe me abic, ",
          "type": "text",
